{
  "MailMarnie01": "Hi @, ^I'm so glad you moved to the valley!^I stopped by to leave you some honey and a few grass starters to help with your farm.^Animals love having a nice green pasture to roam around in.^Take good care of them and they'll take good care of you too!^^^ - Marnie",

  "MailMarnie02": "Hi @!^My chickens have been laying so many eggs lately that I decided to share some with you.^I'm sending you a white egg and a brown egg.^Who knows, maybe this is the beginning of your very own chicken coop!^^^ - Marnie",

  "MailMarnie03": "Hello farmer!^I was thinking about you while organizing a few things around the ranch.^I'm sending you a Mayonnaise Machine and a few more Grass Starters.^Good nutrition makes all the difference when it comes to raising happy animals!^^^ - Marnie",

  "MailMarnie04": "Hi my friend!^Just look at these huge eggs!^My chickens have been very happy lately and rewarded me with an excellent harvest.^I thought it would only be fair to share some with you.^^^ - Marnie",

  "MailMarnie05": "Good morning @!^There's nothing better than a glass of fresh milk with a little honey.^I'm sending you some of both to brighten your day.^Working on a farm sure builds up an appetite, doesn't it?^^^ - Marnie",

  "MailMarnie06": "Hello farmer!^I got a duck egg this morning and thought of you.^I'm also sending you a Cheese Press.^Once you start producing milk in larger quantities, you'll be glad to have it!^^^ - Marnie",

  "MailMarnie07": "Hi @!^The cows on my ranch have been producing excellent milk and my sheep just won't stop giving wool.^I'm sending you a bit of both.^Just feel how soft this wool is!^^^ - Marnie",

  "MailMarnie08": "Good morning my friend!^I'm sending you some goat milk and a Loom.^With a little wool and some patience, you'll be making fine cloth in no time.^I'm sure you'll put it to good use.^^^ - Marnie",

  "MailMarnie09": "Hi @!^The cold days are getting closer, so I decided to send you a Heater for your animals.^I also found a beautiful duck feather this morning and got some excellent quality goat milk.^I'm sure your animals will appreciate the extra warmth!^^^ - Marnie",

  "MailMarnie10": "My friend @,^You've come a long way since moving to the valley.^I'm sending you an Auto-Grabber to make your work a little easier, along with a truffle and a rabbit's foot I found around the ranch.^Keep taking good care of your animals and they'll always reward your hard work!^^^ - Marnie"
}